<title>USA: Celadon names Ronald Roman COO.</title>
<headline>Celadon names Ronald Roman COO.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Celadon Group Inc said it named Ronald Roman chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He was formerly executive vice president for operations of the trucking company.  </p>
<p>The COO position is new, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
